---
---

<section class="panel services" id="services" data-spec="services" aria-labelledby="svc-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="svc-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">02 / What I do <span class="pass">✓ PASSED</span></p>
        <h2 class="h2" id="svc-h" data-split>I test the way <em class="serif">developers build.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <p data-reveal>From a single button click to a thousand concurrent users — three layers, one goal: nothing surprising reaches production.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="svc-grid">
      <article class="svc" data-speed="0.92">
        <div class="mini">
          <div class="mb-top"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="mb-url mono">app.test/checkout</span></div>
          <div class="mb-body">
            <div class="mb-line" style="width:62%"></div><div class="mb-line" style="width:38%"></div>
            <div class="mb-input"></div>
            <div class="mb-btn">Pay now</div>
            <svg class="mb-cursor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 2l16 10-7 1.5L9.5 21z" fill="#10241A" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <div class="mb-toast mono">✓ checkout.spec.ts</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Test automation</h3>
        <p>End-to-end suites that click through real user journeys on every change, so regressions get caught before review.</p>
        <div class="chips"><span class="chip">Playwright</span><span class="chip">JavaScript</span><span class="chip">CI</span></div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc" data-speed="1.05">
        <div class="mini mini-chart">
          <div class="mc-head mono"><span>k6 run load.js</span><span>VUs ▲</span></div>
          <div class="mc-bars">
            <div class="mc-th"></div>
            <i style="--h:22%;--d:0s"></i><i style="--h:30%;--d:.08s"></i><i style="--h:41%;--d:.16s"></i><i style="--h:38%;--d:.24s"></i><i style="--h:52%;--d:.32s"></i><i style="--h:60%;--d:.4s"></i><i style="--h:55%;--d:.48s"></i><i style="--h:63%;--d:.56s"></i><i style="--h:58%;--d:.64s"></i><i style="--h:49%;--d:.72s"></i><i style="--h:44%;--d:.8s"></i><i style="--h:36%;--d:.88s"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="mc-foot mono">✓ http_req_duration p(95) &lt; 500ms</div>
        </div>
        <h3>API &amp; performance</h3>
        <p>Validating endpoints, contracts and error paths — then pushing them with load until the limits are known, not guessed.</p>
        <div class="chips"><span class="chip">API Testing</span><span class="chip">k6</span></div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc" data-speed="1.18">
        <div class="mini mini-check">
          <div class="ck"><i style="--d:0s"></i>Functional<span>passed</span></div>
          <div class="ck"><i style="--d:.4s"></i>Regression<span>passed</span></div>
          <div class="ck"><i style="--d:.8s"></i>Smoke<span>passed</span></div>
          <div class="ck"><i style="--d:1.2s"></i>UAT<span>passed</span></div>
        </div>
        <h3>Manual testing</h3>
        <p>Exploratory sessions, clear test cases and bug reports developers actually enjoy reading — steps, evidence, expected vs actual.</p>
        <div class="chips"><span class="chip">Functional</span><span class="chip">Regression</span><span class="chip">UAT</span></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
